.TH ALI-ALARM 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-alarm \- wake up to the temple at HH:MM
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-alarm HH:MM
.RI [ 1-6 ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Waits until the time (tomorrow if already past), pings, then
plays hymn N (default 2, Oracle's Dance) via
.BR ali-hymns (1).
Keep the terminal open; it sleeps there.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-hymns (1)
